        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"I'm Not a Vampire\"\n- Albums: The Drug in Me Is You\n- Bands: Falling in Reverse, GWAR\n- People: Dave Brockie, Ronnie Radke\n- Events: Bury the Hatchet Tour\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Brockie was born in 1963.\n- Ronnie Radke was born in 1983.\n- Dave Brockie was born before Ronnie Radke.\n- Falling in Reverse performed in the Bury the Hatchet Tour.\n- \"I'm Not a Vampire\" is the third hit single from Falling in Reverse's debut album The Drug in Me Is You.\n- Ronnie Radke is the lead singer of Falling in Reverse.",
